<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ECC" style="id" />
  <para style="h">LATIT LOK</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buk pa Latit lok</para>
  <para style="toc2">Latit lok</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Buk pa</para>
  <para style="mt1">LATIT LOK</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Buk pa Latit lok </char> opong ki tam pa dano matamo tam matut dok tato tyen lok ducu. Latam matut man oneno ni kwo pa dano i lobo man cek tutwal dok opong ki jami maracu ma oweko en ogiko loke ni kwo gin ma konye peke. Dok en pe eromo niang tam pa Lubanga ma en aye obedo ngat matye ki twero ikom gin matime ikom dano acel acel. Kadi bed kitmeno en ogiko kun miyo tam ki dano ni gin omyero gutii matek, ki bene ni gin omyero gunong mit pa jami ducu ma Lubanga won twer miyo botgi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pol lok pa Latam matut man opong ki lok ma pe tye ki cwak mo ma adii ikom kwo me lobo man. Kadi bed tye kitmeno pi tyen lok ni buk man dong tye i Baibul, meno nyutu atir ni niye ma a ki i Baibul tye ma okwako jami ducu ma okemo kwo. Jo mapol gunongo yomcwiny kun gingine ki madara me buk man, ci gunongo ni en buk aceli miyo goro me cwiny ikom kwo dok ki tung cel bene miyo gen madit ma a ki bot Lubanga ma miyo dano ngeyo tyen lok me kwo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Tika kwo tye ki tyen lok mo? <char style="ior"><ref loc="ECC 1:1-2:26">1:1—2:26</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lok mogo ma mako kwo <char style="ior"><ref loc="ECC 3:1-11:8">3:1—11:8</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Miyo tam me agiki <char style="ior"><ref loc="ECC 11:9-12:8">11:9—12:8</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ladol wilok <char style="ior"><ref loc="ECC 12:9-14">12:9-14</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ECC 1" />
  <para style="s1">Kwo me lobo man ducu konygi peke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 1:1" />Magi aye lok pa latit lok, wod pa Daudi, ma obedo rwot i Jerucalem.<verse eid="ECC 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 1:2" />Latit lok owaco ni, konygi peke, konygi peke! Gin ducu konygi peke. <verse eid="ECC 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 1:3" />Dano twero nongo kit magoba ango ki ikom tic matek ma en tiyo dyeceng jwini? <verse eid="ECC 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 1:4" />Yalwak me kare man kato, ci dok yalwak mukene leyo kakargi, ento lobo bedo mere matwal. <verse eid="ECC 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 1:5" />Ceng tuc ci cito poto, ka dok loke oyotoyot dok kama en tuc ki iye. <verse eid="ECC 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 1:6" />Yamo kodo dok tung kupiny, ka dok wire kodo dok tung kumalo; bedo kakodo tungi ki tungi, ka dok loke rumu piny aruma. <verse eid="ECC 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 1:7" />Pii ma opong i kulu ducu mol cito i nam, ento nam pe pong; pii dok cen kama kulu ocake ki iye, ka cako mol ki kunu dwogo i nam. <verse eid="ECC 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 1:8" />Kom dano dong pong woko aponga ki olokom ma pe gitwero titone; wang dano pe twero yeng ki gin ma dano neno, kadi ki it bene pe twero yeng ki gin ma winyo. <verse eid="ECC 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 1:9" />Gin ma dong otyeko time en aye gin ma bitime bene, ki gin ma kityeko tiyo en aye bene gin ma kibitiyo; pimeno pe tye gin mo manyen iwi loboni kulu. <verse eid="ECC 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 1:10" />Tye gin mo ma kiloko pire ni, “Nen, man gin manyen”? Man otyeko time wacon, ikare ma onongo pud peya kinywalowa. <verse eid="ECC 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 1:11" />Dano pe po ikom gin ma otime yam wacon, dok ikare me anyim bene pe tye ngat mo ma bipo ikom gin ma tye katime ikare man.<verse eid="ECC 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yenyo ryeko bene konye peke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 1:12" />An Latam matut onongo abedo rwot maloyo jo Icrael i Jerucalem. <verse eid="ECC 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 1:13" />Amoko tama me tato ki ngiyo ki diro gin ducu ma dano gitye katiyone ite polo i lobo kany.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ECC 1:13">Lubanga omiyo tic ma kelo cwercwiny keken bot dano ma myero gubed katiyone. <verse eid="ECC 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 1:14" />Atyeko neno gin ducu ma kitye katiyone i lobo kany, ci aneno ni gin ducu konygi peke, dok bedo calo ryemo kor yamo ma kodo. <verse eid="ECC 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 1:15" />Gin ma ogom pe dong kitwero twenyone bedo atir, dok jami ma komgi pe nen, pe kitwero kwanogi.<verse eid="ECC 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 1:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 4:29-31">1 Luk 4:29-31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ci an aloko kekena ni, “An dong alimo ryeko madit makato ryeko pa luker ducu ma gukwongo nyima ma gubedo kaloc i Jerucalem. Angeyo kit ma ryeko ki ngec ducu bedo kwede.” <verse eid="ECC 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 1:17" />Aketo cwinya me ngeyo ryeko, ki me ngeyo apoya ki mingo. Anongo ni magi ducu bene obedo calo ryemo kor yamo ma kodo. <verse eid="ECC 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 1:18" />Pien bedo ki ryeko madwong miyo dano bedo ki cwercwiny madwong bene, ki ngat ma ngece tye kamede meno nongo tye kamedo cwercwiny bote.<verse eid="ECC 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ECC 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 2:1" />Aloko kekena ni, “Bin ba, amito kong atem yomo cwinya wek aniang kit ma yomcwiny tye kwede.” Ento anongo ni man bene gin ma konye peke. <verse eid="ECC 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 2:2" />Ka aloko kekena ni nyero obedo gin me apoya, ki gin ma yomo cwiny obedo gin ma pe konyo. <verse eid="ECC 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 2:3" />Atamo ni myero kong atem mato kongo bwino wek olyet koma, kun nongo tama tye katela ki ryeko, dok ni kong atem ngiyo kit tim me mingo, nio wang ma aneno gin maber atika ma myero dano gutii ikare manok me kwogi ma gibedo kwede i lobo.<verse eid="ECC 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 2:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 10:23-27">1 Luk 10:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:22-27">2 Tek 9:22-27</ref></char>
    </note>Atiyo tic matego; agero odi, ka dok apito olok. <verse eid="ECC 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 2:5" />Ayubu poti mabeco me yomcwiny ma kicelogi woko ki cel, ci apito iye kwa yadi ducu ma nyak ma kicamo nyiggi. <verse eid="ECC 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 2:6" />Dok akwinyo dago kama pii gure iye me aonya ite yadi ma gitye ka dongo i kabedo ma kiyubu me bunga. <verse eid="ECC 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 2:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:23">1 Luk 4:23</ref></char></note>Awilo opii ki angeca; ka dok abedo ki opii ma kinywalogi ki ikin jo ma i oda. Abedo ki lwak dyangi kacel ki romi mapol, kun akato jo ducu ma gukwongo nyima ma gubedo kaloc i Jerucalem. <verse eid="ECC 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 2:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:10">1 Luk 10:10</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 14:22">14:22</ref></char></note>Acoko lwak ryal ki jabu ki lonyo pa luker kacel ki dul lobo mayam giloyo odoko mera. Abedo bene ki luwer ma co ki ma mon, kacel ki mon mapol mapatpat ki gin ducu ma yomo cwiny dano.<verse eid="ECC 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 2:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 29:25">1 Tek 29:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kitmeno adoko twon dano mo madit ma pe wace, kun aloyo bene wa jo ducu ma gukwongo nyima ma gubedo kaloc i Jerucalem; ryekona aye obedo ka konya. <verse eid="ECC 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 2:10" />Dok gin mo keken ma amito, ka wanga oneno, anongo; dok pe akwero gin ma yomo cwiny dano, pien anongo yomcwiny ma dwong i tic ducu ma abedo katiyone. Dong meno aye obedo mot pi tic ma atiyo. <verse eid="ECC 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 2:11" />Lacen aloke acako ngiyo jami ducu ma atiyo ki cinga ki kit ma ayele kwede katiyone, ci nen, anongo ni man gin ma konye peke, rom ki ryemo kor yamo ma kodo, dok ni pe tye kit magoba mo ma dano twero nongo i lobo.<verse eid="ECC 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 2:12" />Kitmeno aloke abedo katamo tam matut ikom ryeko, apoya ki mingo. Ci anongo ni gin mo ma ngat ma oleyo ka tyen rwot twero timo peke. Myero en olub gin ma rwot ma okwongo nyime otiyo. <verse eid="ECC 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 2:13" />Ci cutcut aniang ni ryeko ber kato mingo macalo deru kato colpiny. <verse eid="ECC 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 2:14" />Dano ma ryek neno yoo kama en cito iye, ma nongo ngat ma laming woto mere i colpiny; ento kadi bed kumeno gin aryoni ducu gibibedo ki agiki maromrom. <verse eid="ECC 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 2:15" />Ka dok aloko kekena ni, “Gin ma bipoto ikom ngat ma laming bipoto ikoma bene; ka kumeno pingo kono abedo ma ryek tutwal?” Ci adok iye kekena ni, man bene gin ma konye peke. <verse eid="ECC 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 2:16" />Pe tye ngat mo matwero po pi dano ma laryeko kadi pi laming, pien ikare ma tye anyim nongo wi dano dong otyeko wil woko wacon ikom gin aryo ducu. Dano ma ryek ki dano ma laming ducu gito i yo marom aroma! <verse eid="ECC 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 2:17" />Kitmeno iya okwero bedo kwo, pien gin ma gitye katiyone i lobo man obedo gin ma kelo can i koma keken; pien gin ducu ma gitiyo konye peke, rom ki ryemo kor yamo ma kodo.<verse eid="ECC 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 2:18" />Cwinya ocako kwero tica ducu ma atiyo i lobo man, kun aneno ni jami ducu ma anongo myero abwot ki ngat ma bileyo ka tyena, <verse eid="ECC 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 2:19" />dong anga mono ma ngeyo kace en bibedo dano ma laryeko nyo laming? Kadi bed kit meno en bibedo ladit maloyo jami ducu mayam alimo kun atiyo pirgi matek, ma ayele kwede katiyone kun atiyo ki ryekona i lobo man. Man bene gin ma konye peke. <verse eid="ECC 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 2:20" />Ci aloke abedo ki cwercwiny ma iya oari woko ikom tica ma atiyo i lobo man, <verse eid="ECC 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 2:21" />pien kare mogo dano ma otiyo tic matek ki ryekone, ki ngec ma en tye kwede dok ki kwirine ducu myero owek jamine bot dano mo ma pe otiyo tic mo liweng pi jami magi, wek ole olony kwede labedo. Man bene gin ma konye peke, dok tye gin marac tutwal. <verse eid="ECC 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 2:22" />Kit gin ango ma dano nongo ki ikom tice ducu, ki kero ma en otiyo kwede tic i lobo man? <verse eid="ECC 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ECC 2:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:7">Yub 5:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 14:1">14:1</ref></char></note>Mwaka me kwone ducu opong ki arem, ki tice bene kelo bote cwercwiny keken; kadi wa i dyewor wiye pe twero ywe ki tam. Man bene gin ma konye peke.<verse eid="ECC 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ECC 2:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 3:13">Lat 3:13</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 5:18">5:18</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 9:7">9:7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:19">Luk 12:19</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:32">1 Kor 15:32</ref></char>
    </note>Dong gin maber makato ma dano myero otim en aye ni en omyero ocam cam dok omat mat, wek onong yomcwiny i tic ma en tiyo. Ento aneno ni man bene Lubanga aye ma omiyo; <verse eid="ECC 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ECC 2:25" />pien ka Lubanga pe, ngat mo pe twero camo cam dok ngat mo pe twero nongo yomcwiny. <verse eid="ECC 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ECC 2:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 32:8">Yub 32:8</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 2:6">Car 2:6</ref></char></note>Lubanga miyo ryeko, ngec ki yomcwiny bot dano ma en pwoyo; ento bot dano ma labalo en miye tic me guru jami ki durugi kacel, me amiya bot ngat ma onongo pwoc ki bote. Man bene gin ma konye peke, rom ki ryemo kor yamo ma kodo.<verse eid="ECC 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ECC 3" />
  <para style="s1">Kit tim acel acel tye ki karene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 3:1" />Kit tim acel acel ducu tye ki karene, dok kit lok mo keken tye ki karene i lobo man.<verse eid="ECC 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 3:2" />Kare ma kinywalo iye dano, ki kare ma en bito iye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:2">kare me pito ginapita, ki kare me putu gin ma kipitoni woko;<verse eid="ECC 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 3:3" />kare me neko dano, ki kare me cango dano acanga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:3">kare me muku ot ki retone woko piny, ki kare me gerone odoco.<verse eid="ECC 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 3:4" />Kare me koko, ki kare me nyero;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:4">kare me kumu, ki kare me myel;<verse eid="ECC 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 3:5" />kare me bolo got atata, ki kare me gurune kacel;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:5">kare me kwako lawoti, ki kare ma pe ikwako iye lawoti;<verse eid="ECC 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 3:6" />kare me yenyo jami, ki kare ma jami rwenyo ki iye arwenya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:6">kare me gwoko gin moni, ki kare me bolone woko;<verse eid="ECC 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 3:7" />kare me yeco bongo ki kare me kwoyone woko doki;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:7">kare me ling alinga, ki kare me lok;<verse eid="ECC 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 3:8" />kare me maro dano, ki kare me kwero dano akwera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:8">kare me lweny, ki kare me bedo ki kuc.<verse eid="ECC 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 3:9" />Dano ma latic mono nongo kit magoba ango ikom tic ducu ma en tiyo?<verse eid="ECC 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 3:10" />Dong atyeko neno kit tic ma Lubanga omiyo bot dano ma myero gubed katiyone. <verse eid="ECC 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 3:11" />En oketo jami ducu maber ma oporo karegi kikome; dok oketo dano me ngeyo kare mukato angec ki kare ma pud tye anyim, ento kadi kumeno dano pe twero ngeyo gin ma Lubanga otiyo nia i acaki nio i agiki. <verse eid="ECC 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 3:12" />Ci aniang atir ni pe tye gin mo maber pi dano makato kono bedo ki yomcwiny pi kare me kwone ducu i lobo man. <verse eid="ECC 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 3:13" />Dok aniang bene ni man obedo mot ma Lubanga omiyo bot dano, kun mito ni dano acel acel myero ocam cam, dok omat mat, ci onong yomcwiny ma a ki ikom tice ducu ma en tiyo.<verse eid="ECC 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 3:14" />Angeyo ni gin mo keken ma Lubanga tiyo bedo matwal; pe kitwero medo gin mo iye, dok pe kitwero kwanyo gin mo woko ki ikome. Lubanga oketo obedo kitmeno, wek omii dano gubed ki lworo inyime. <verse eid="ECC 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 3:15" />Gin ma tye katimeni dong yam otyeko time con; ki gin ma bitime i anyim bene dong otyeko time woko; Lubanga weko kit gin acelu mayam otime, ci miyo dok time aye.<verse eid="ECC 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tim ma atir peke i lobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 3:16" />Pe meno keken, anongo ni i lobo man kama myero tim ma atir obed tye iye inongo tim maracu aye, dok bene kama myero dano gubed ki kit ma atir inongo tim maracu iye. <verse eid="ECC 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 3:17" />Abedo kalok kekena ki i cwinya ni, Lubanga bingolokop ikom jo ma kitgi atir kacel ki lutim maracu, pien dong otyeko yero kare pi kit lok acel acel, ki pi kit tic ducu. <verse eid="ECC 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 3:18" />Abedo katamo ki i cwinya ni, Lubanga tye katemo dano atema wek enyut botgi ni kadi bed gin dano ento gin rom aroma ki lee tim. <verse eid="ECC 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 3:19" />Pien can ma poto ikom dano ki gin ma time ikom lee tim ducu rom aroma; gin ducu gito woko. Gin ducu kimiyogi yweyo me kwo maromrom, ci dano pe bedo maber makato lee; pien gin ducu konygi peke. <verse eid="ECC 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 3:20" />Gin aryo ducu gicito i kabedo acel; pien gin ducu gua ki i apwa, dok gibidok iye aye. <verse eid="ECC 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 3:21" />Anga ma ngeyo kace tipu pa dano cito malo i polo, nyo ka tipu pa lee donyo piny i ngom? <verse eid="ECC 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 3:22" />Kitmeno aniang ni gin maber makato ducu ma dano twero timo en aye me yomo cwinye ki gin ma en olimo ki i tice ma en otiyo, pien meno aye dul ma kipoko bote. Anga matwero nyute gin ma bitime lacen i anyim ma nongo en dong oto woko?<verse eid="ECC 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ECC 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 4:1" />Dok aneno kit macalo jo mukene tye kaunu ki luwotgi i lobo man. Nen, jo ma kiunugi gikok akoka ki pig wanggi, pien pe gitye ki ngat mo ma myero okwe cwinygi! Pe gitye ki ngat mo ma konyogi, pien jo ma unugi nongo gitye ki twero. <verse eid="ECC 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 4:2" />Omiyo atamo ni jo ma dong guto woko komgi gum kato jo makwo ma pud gudong ma gibedo i lobo man. <verse eid="ECC 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 4:3" />Ento ngat makato gin ducu en aye dano ma pud peya kinywalo, ma peya oneno tim maracu ma kitye katimone i loboni.<verse eid="ECC 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 4:4" />Atyeko neno bene ni tic ducu ma dano tiyo ki dirone ducu, tiyo pi nyeko ma en tye kwede ikom lawote, ni myero en aye ebed ki jami makato lawote. Man bene gin ma konye peke, dok rom ki ryemo kor yamo ma kodo.<verse eid="ECC 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 4:5" />Dano ma laming bedo abeda ma odolo cinge, pimeno kec bineke nio wang ma oto.<verse eid="ECC 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 4:6" />Ka itye ki jami manok ma romo pongcing keken, kun itiyo kwede inongo ni itye ki kuc i cwinyi, ber kato jami matye pongcing aryo ma kuc mo pe iye ma opong ki tic matek, dok bene man rom ki ryemo kor yamo ma kodo.<verse eid="ECC 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 4:7" />Dok aniang bene ni tye gin mukene ma konye peke i lobo man. <verse eid="ECC 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 4:8" />Inongo dano ma bedo kene, ma pe tye ki lareme mo, latine mo bene peke, kadi omine mo bene peke, ento pud inongo ni tye katiyo tic matek ma pe ywe, ento ki tung bote neno ni lonyo ma etye kwedeni pud pe rome. En bene pe twero penye kekene ni, “Tic matek ma atye katiyoneni mono atiyo pi anga, ma genga woko ki nongo yomcwinyi?” Man bene gin ma konye peke, dok gin ma pe miyo yomcwiny bot dano.<verse eid="ECC 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 4:9" />Bedo jo aryo ber kato ma dano acel obedo kene, pien gin jo aryonu gitwero nongo pwoc maber ma a ikom tic ma gitiyo. <verse eid="ECC 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 4:10" />Ikin jo aryoni ka ngat acel opoto piny, ci lawote ile woko malo; ento ngat ma bedo kene tye ki can, pien ka opoto piny pe tye ngat mo mukene matwero ile woko malo. <verse eid="ECC 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 4:11" />Dok ka jo aryo gubutu i kabutu acel kacel, gin ducu komgi bedo lyet, ento ka dano acel obutu i kabutu kene, ci kome twero bedo lyet ningning? <verse eid="ECC 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 4:12" />Kadi bed dano mo twero bwoyo ngat ma tye kene, ento jo aryo kulu bwoyo en woko marac tutwal. Pe tye ngat mo matwero codo tol adek ma kiwiyogi kacel oyotoyot.<verse eid="ECC 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 4:13" />Awobi ma lacan dok ma ryek ber kato rwot ma otii ma laming, ma pe dong winyo tam ducu ma kimiye. <verse eid="ECC 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 4:14" />Awobi macalo meno twero doko laloc me lobo, kadi bed kinywale ma en lacan onyo ka kigonyo woko ki i buc. <verse eid="ECC 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 4:15" />Ento awobi matidi mukene doko laloc lobo, ci lwak ducu gicwako en. <verse eid="ECC 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 4:16" />Aneno ni lwak jo ma pe kwane gipong kun gicwako en. Ento inge mwaka manok mo keken gin bikwere woko. Adada man bene gin ma konye peke, dok rom ki ryemo kor yamo ma kodo.<verse eid="ECC 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ECC 5" />
  <para style="s1">Pe ikwong kwong rucurucu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 5:1" />Myero igwok kiti ka icito ka donyo i Ot pa Lubanga; pien nyiko cok kawinyo lok pa Lubanga ber kato gitum ma luming gimiyo bote, pien gin pe gingeyo ni gitye katimo bal. <verse eid="ECC 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 5:2" />Myero kong ikwong tamo pi gin ma imito loko ma peya iloko gin mo, pe myero icike oyotoyot inyim Lubanga; myero ilok manok mo keken inyime, pien en tye i polo, ki in itye i lobo.<verse eid="ECC 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 5:3" />Ka ibedo kaparo par mapol ci lek bino iwii, dok ka in lalok mapol, ci polkare bene ibibedo lalok mingomingo.<verse eid="ECC 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 5:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 66:13-14">Jab 66:13-14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pimeno ka ikwonge bot Lubanga pe igale, dok myero igwok kwongi; pien Lubanga cwinye pe yom ikom luming. Myero icob gin ma in dong ikwongo. <verse eid="ECC 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 5:5" />Onongo bedo ber ka in pe ikwongo kwong mo, kato ma ikwonge kun pe icobo gin ma ikwongo. <verse eid="ECC 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 5:6" />Pe iwek lok ma iloko oteri katimo bal, dok pe myero iwac bot lukwena pa Lubanga ni meno dogi onongo ocer acera. Pingo iweko kiniga mako Lubanga ikomi pi lok ma iloko, ma miyo en balo tici ducu mayam itiyo ki cingini?<verse eid="ECC 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 5:7" />Myero ilwor Lubanga, kadi bed lek mapol bimede ki bino iwii, ma miyo iloko lok ma dwong ata ma konygi peke.<verse eid="ECC 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwo konye peke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 5:8" />Pe myero ibed ki ur mo kace ineno ni lucan ma gitye i dul lobo mo kitye ka unugi, ma kopgi pe kingolo atir kun kitimogi ki tim me bwami; pien tye laloc madit ma kato en, dok gin aryonu ducu bene gitye ki luloc madito katogi. <verse eid="ECC 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 5:9" />Dong gin maber makato ducu, en aye rwot mo ma omiyo lobo ma en loyo kipuru dok kipito iye cam ma dwong pi lwake.<verse eid="ECC 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 5:10" />Ngat ma maro lim, lim pe twero romone wa ki acel; ki ngat ma maro lonyo bene kadi bed nongo magoba ma dwong, pud dok waco ni peya orome. Man bene gin ma konye peke.<verse eid="ECC 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 5:11" />Ka lonyo pa dano woto ki mede, ci jo ma gicamo cinge bene ginya mede ameda. Dong kit kony ango ma lalonyo man tye kwede? En neno lonyone anena ki wange keken.<verse eid="ECC 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 5:12" />Ngat ma latic matek nino mot liywi, kadi bed camo cam manok nyo madwong, ento ngat ma olony mukato kare pe nino pien bedo kaparo lonyone.<verse eid="ECC 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 5:13" />Gin marac tutwal ma aneno i lobo en aye ni: dano kano lwak lonyo ma dwong, ci lacen dok lonyo meno kelo can ikomgi, <verse eid="ECC 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 5:14" />dok lwak lonyogini rwenyo woko liweng pi gum marac. Man miyo dano dong ki cinge nono labongo gin mo ma en twero pito ki lutinone. <verse eid="ECC 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 5:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:21">Yub 1:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 49:17">Jab 49:17</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 6:7">1 Tem 6:7</ref></char></note>Pimeno kit macalo dano yam mine onywale kwede i lobo man ma tye munero, en bene biweko lobo man dok ki cinge nono labongo gin mo, pe bikwanyo jami mo ma oa ikom tice kadi ki acel ma bimako i cinge kun cito kwede. <verse eid="ECC 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 5:16" />Man bene gin marac atika! Kit macalo en obino i lobo nono labongo gin moni, en bene bidok nono kitmeno. Ci dong dano meno nongo kit pwoc ango ikom tice ma en otiyo? Otiyo tic me mako yamo keken. <verse eid="ECC 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 5:17" />Pi kare me kwone ducu en obedo i colpiny ki can ki cwercwiny ma dwong mukato kare, dok ki two wa ki keccwiny.<verse eid="ECC 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 5:18" />Dong gin maber ma aneno ma myero dano otim en ene: en myero ocam cam dok omat mat bene wek onong yomcwiny ikom tice ducu ma en otiyo pi kare manok me kwone ma Lubanga omiye i lobo man, pien man aye dul ma kipoko bote. <verse eid="ECC 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 5:19" />Dano acel acel ma Lubanga omiye lonyo, kacel ki jami ma dwong wa ki twero me yomo cwinye ki jami magi, mito ogam dul ma kipokoni obed mere, wek onong yomcwiny ikom tice, pien man aye mot ma Lubanga omiyo. <verse eid="ECC 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 5:20" />Man miyo dano pe po ni kare me kwone nok tutwal, pien Lubanga oye ni en obed kun cwinye yom.<verse eid="ECC 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ECC 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 6:1" />Atyeko neno bal marac mapek ma obwoyo kom dano ducu ma bedo i lobo man. <verse eid="ECC 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 6:2" />Lubanga twero miyo bot dano mo lonyo, lwak jami mapol ata, dok miyo dano giwore, weko dano meno bedo ma gin mo keken ma en mito pe rem bote, ento ka Lubanga pe omiye twero me nongo yomcwiny ikom lwak lonyoneni, ci dano mo ata aye binongo yomcwiny ikom jamine ducu; man gin ma konye peke. Man aye can marac mukato kare. <verse eid="ECC 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 6:3" />Kadi bed dano mo onywal lutino ma romo miya acel kulu, kadi en obedo i lobo pi lwak mwaka mapol, ma mwakane bene dong dwong, ento ka pe onongo yomcwiny mo ikom jami mabeco me lobo man, ka pe bene kiketo deyo me yiko en ka oto, awaco ni latin ma kinywalo ma dong otyeko to woko ki i ic ber kato en woko. <verse eid="ECC 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 6:4" />Kony me nywalo latin meno peke, pien en cito i colpiny, ka dong tye i colpiny ci wi dano wil woko pi nyinge. <verse eid="ECC 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 6:5" />Dok latin meno pe oneno ceng, pe ongeyo gin mo; ento en nongo yweyo maber makato dano meno maditi, <verse eid="ECC 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 6:6" />kadi bed dano meno orii i lobo pi mwaka alip aryo kulu, kun nongo pe obedo ki jami mabeco i lobo man. Pien i agikine gin aryoni ducu gicito i kabedo aceli.<verse eid="ECC 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 6:7" />Dano tiyo tice ducu wek enong gin ma myero ecam, ento pe romo yeng ki cam ma en nongo. <verse eid="ECC 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 6:8" />Gin ango maber ma dano ma ryek tye kwede makato ngat ma laming? Dok gin ango kono maber ma lacan ma ngeyo gwoko kwone tye kwede ikin jo makwo? <verse eid="ECC 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 6:9" />Bedo ber ka jami ma itye kwedeni oromi, kato ma ibedo ki par ma dwong pi jami mukene; man bene gin ma konye peke, rom ki ryemo kor yamo ma kodo.<verse eid="ECC 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 6:10" />Gin ma tye katimeni onongo dong kityeko moko wa yam con, dok wangeyo ni dano pe twero pyem ki ngat matek makato en. <verse eid="ECC 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 6:11" />Ka dano pyem kun loko lok ma dwong, ci loke ducu doko gin ma konye peke, nongo en yele nono. <verse eid="ECC 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 6:12" />Anga ma ngeyo gin maber pi dano ma kun nongo en obedo pi kare manok ki kit kwo ma konye peke, pien kwone rwenyo woko macalo tipu? Anga ma ngeyo gin ma bitime iwi lobo inge tone?<verse eid="ECC 6:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ECC 7" />
  <para style="s1">Tam ma mako kwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 7:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 22:1">Car 22:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Bedo ki nying maber ber kato moo me wel ma ngwece kur; ki nino me to pa dano, ber kato nino ma kinywale iye.<verse eid="ECC 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 7:2" />Bedo ber me cito i ot kama dano tye iye kakumu pi lato, kato ma icito i ot kama kiyubu iye karama; pien to aye agiki pa dano ducu, jo makwo gibipo ilok man dok gibiketo cwinygi iye.<verse eid="ECC 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 7:3" />Cwercwiny ber kato nyero, cwercwiny miyo wangi nen ki can ci miyo niang matut boti in dano moni. <verse eid="ECC 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 7:4" />Tam pa dano ma ryek rwate ki tam pa jo ma gitye kakumu i ot; ento luming tamgi rwate ki tam pa jo ma gitye i ot kama kinongo iye yomcwiny.<verse eid="ECC 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 7:5" />Ka dano owinyo juk pa ngat ma ryek ber, kato ma en obedo kawinyo wer pa luming.<verse eid="ECC 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 7:6" />Nyero pa luming obedo gin ma konye peke; cal ki yen okutu ma kirwako i mac ite agulu dek, ma wang mwoc lirwatrwat.<verse eid="ECC 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 7:7" />Dano ma ryek ka unu dano, loke doko ngat ma laming, dok gamo lim me wilo dano i mung balo tam pa dano woko.<verse eid="ECC 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 7:8" />Agiki pa gin moni ber kato acakine; dok dano ma diyo cwinye ber kato ngat ma lawake.<verse eid="ECC 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 7:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JAS 1:19">Yak 1:19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pe myero iwek kiniga omaki oyotoyot; jo ma luming aye kano kiniga i cwinygi.<verse eid="ECC 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 7:10" />Pe myero ipeny ni, “Pingo jami me kare ma okato angec ber makato me kare man!” Peny macalo man nyutu ni i peke ki ryeko.<verse eid="ECC 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 7:11" />Dano acel acel ma bedo i lobo myero obed ryek, pien ryeko ber macalo ngom ma dano oleyo ki bot kwarone.<verse eid="ECC 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 7:12" />Ryeko twero gwoko dano kit macalo lim gwoko ki ngat ma tye kwede; ryeko gwoko kwo pa ngat ma ryek, man aye ber me bedo ki ngec.<verse eid="ECC 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 7:13" />Kong itam pi tic pa Lubanga; anga ma twero twenyo gin ma en oketo ma ogom wek obed atir?<verse eid="ECC 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 7:14" />Bed ki yomcwiny ikare ma itye maber, dok ikare ma piny rac ber ipo ni; Lubanga aye ma miyo dano gibedo maber nyo marac, wek dano pe gunge gin ma bitime lacen ma nongo dong guto woko.<verse eid="ECC 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 7:15" />Anongo ni kwona kara konye peke, kadi bed oweko aneno jami ducu. Aneno ni dano ma kite atir to pi lengcwinye, kun dano marac ma en latim marac bedo rii nakanaka ikom time maraci. <verse eid="ECC 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 7:16" />Pe myero ibed dano ma kite atir tutwal, pe bene ikete keni me bedo ryek ma okato kare. Pingo imito neke woko kekeni? <verse eid="ECC 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 7:17" />Dok pe myero ibed dano marac ma okato kare, pe ibed laming bene. Imito ni ito woko pingo, ma pud peya kareni oromo? <verse eid="ECC 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 7:18" />Bedo ber ka pe ibedo ngat ma timo tim me mingo onyo gin marac; pien lworo Lubanga miyo ibwot ki ikom gin aryoni ducu.<verse eid="ECC 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 7:19" />Ryeko miyo teko bot dano ma ryek, kato gin ma luloc apar kulu twero tiyo i taun madit ma gitye iye.<verse eid="ECC 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 7:20" />Adada pe tye dano mo ma kite atir i lobo man, ma timo gin maber keken ma pe balo.<verse eid="ECC 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 7:21" />Pe icik iti me winyo lok ducu ma dano giwaco, miyo iwinyo lok mogo maracu ma latici loko me yeto in. <verse eid="ECC 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 7:22" />Dok in bene ingeyo ki i cwinyi kekeni ni tyen mapol ata ibedo kaloko lok maracu kun iyeto ki jo mukene.<verse eid="ECC 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ECC 7:23" />Atiyo ki ryekona me temo man ducu, kun awaco ni, “Abibedo ryek”; ento pe atwero nongo, pien ryeko tye kamabor kweda. <verse eid="ECC 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ECC 7:24" />Ngat mo twero yenyo tyen kwo ningning? Tye kamabor, matut dok matut adada; oweko pe tye ngat mo ma twero niang iye. <verse eid="ECC 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ECC 7:25" />Amoko tama me ngeyo ki me yenyo ryeko, kun amito aniang kama ryeko twero nonge iye, dok me niang tyen lok me jami ducu, ci aniang atir ni tim maracu aye mingo, ki tim mingo aye apoya kikome.<verse eid="ECC 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ECC 7:26" />Man aye gin ma bene anongo: tye kit dako marac makato to. Cinge ma gwaki kwedeni ki mare tye calo owic ma maki macalo nyor me tweyo dano. Ngat ma tiyo gin ma Lubanga mito twero bwot woko ki bote, ento ngat ma labalo aye dako meno twero makone. <verse eid="ECC 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ECC 7:27" />Nen ba, man aye gin ma dong atyeko niang, abedo ka nongo man motmot ikare ma atye kayenyo tyen lok ducu, <verse eid="ECC 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ECC 7:28" />ma obedo kabino i tama teretere, ento pe amedo ki nongo gin mo. Ikin dano alip acel anongo iye laco acel keken ma atwero woro, ento pe anongo dako mo kadi ki acel ikin gi ducu. <verse eid="ECC 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ECC 7:29" />Nen man aye gin acel keken ma anongo: Lubanga gire onongo ocweyo dano ma cwinygi tye atir, ento dano aye guyenyo yo mapol me timo jami maracu mapatpat.<verse eid="ECC 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ECC 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 8:1" />Anga macalo dano ma ryek? Dok anga ma ngeyo gonyo tyen lok mo? Ryeko miyo cwiny dano bedo ma yom, dok miyo colwang me adagadaga ma en tye kwede rweny woko.<verse eid="ECC 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lub cik pa rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 8:2" />Myero ilub gin ma rwot ociko, pien ikwonge inyim Lubanga ni ibicobone. <verse eid="ECC 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 8:3" />Pe igale inyim rwot; a woko ka lok dong odoko rac, pien rwot twero timo gin mo keken ma en mito ikomi. <verse eid="ECC 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 8:4" />Rwot loko kitwero, dok anga ma twero waco bote ni, “In itimo man pingo?” <verse eid="ECC 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 8:5" />Ngat ma lubu gin ma en ociko pe birwate ki kit peko mo, dok dano ma ryek ngeyo kare, ki yo maber me aluba. <verse eid="ECC 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 8:6" />Kit lok acel acel tye ki karene dok ki yone, kadi bed ayela tye mapek ma obwoyo kom dano woko. <verse eid="ECC 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 8:7" />Dano pe ngeyo gin ma bitime i anyim, pimeno anga ma twero tito botwa gin ma bitime. <verse eid="ECC 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 8:8" />Pe tye dano mo ma tye ki twero me gwoko tipune, kadi ki twero me gengo ni en pe etoo ka nino me tone oromo. Wan pe watwero nguny ki ngewa pi lweny man, dok tim maracu bene pe bilaro jo ma gin lutim maracu.<verse eid="ECC 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo maracu ki jo ma kitgi atir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 8:9" />Man ducu aneno kun aporo ki jami ducu ma tye katime i lobo, kun dano ma tye ki twero loyo jo mukene ki tek. <verse eid="ECC 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 8:10" />Lacen aneno ka kiyiko lutim maracu; ma ka dano gia ki iwi lyel gidok paco, dano pakogi mada i taun madit ka mayam gutimo iye tim maracu. Man bene gin ma konye peke.<verse eid="ECC 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 8:11" />Ka pe kimiyo pwod oyotoyot ikom dano ka otimo gin marac, miyo jo mukene bene giketo cwinygi atika pi timo gin marac. <verse eid="ECC 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 8:12" />Kadi bed labalo otim gin marac ma romo tyen miya acel kun medo mwaka ma myero eri kwede i lobo, ento an angeyo atir ni jo ma gilworo Lubanga aye gibibedo maber, pien gibedo ki lworo inyime. <verse eid="ECC 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 8:13" />Ngat ma latim marac pe bibedo maber wa ki acel, dok bene en calo tipu, pe birii i lobo pi kare malac, pien en pe tye ki lworo inyim Lubanga.<verse eid="ECC 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 8:14" />Tye gin ma konye peke ma tye katime i lobo; tye jo mogo ma kitgi atir ma can poto ikomgi ma myero opot ikom lutim maracu, dok tye lutim maracu mogo ma ginongo gum maber ma opore pi jo ma kitgi atir. Ci awaco ni man bene gin ma konye peke.<verse eid="ECC 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 8:15" />Dong aniang maber ni gin ma mite ma myero dano otim en aye me bedo ki yomcwiny, pien pe tye gin mo maber i lobo kany pi dano, kono me cam ki mato gin amatagu, wek oyom cwinye macalo en twero, pien man aye gin ma en biwot kwede i tice ducu ma otiyo, ikare me kwone ducu ma Lubanga omiye i lobo man.<verse eid="ECC 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 8:16" />Ka aketo cwinya me niang matut i kit yo ma ryeko tiyo kwede, ki dok me neno tic ma dano gitiyo i lobo, kun aneno dano pe miyo wange pi nino i dyeceng kadi i dyewor, <verse eid="ECC 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 8:17" />ci aneno tic ducu ma Lubanga otiyo, aniang ni dano kara pe twero ngeyo gin ma tye katime i lobo. Kadi bed dano mo oyele marom mene me yenyone, pud pe binongo; dok kadi bed dano ma laryeko tamo ni engeyo, pe twero nongone bene.<verse eid="ECC 8:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ECC 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 9:1" />Aketo i cwinya, kun angiyo ducu maber, ci anongo ni, jo ma kitgi atir ki jo ma luryeko, gin ducu ma gitiyo tye i cing Lubanga; kono obedo mar nyo adagadaga. Pe tye dano mo ma ngeyo gin ducu ma pud tye anyim. <verse eid="ECC 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 9:2" />Apokapoka mo peke, pien kit can acel bipoto ikomgi ducu, bipoto ikom jo ma kitgi atir kacel ki ikom jo ma gin lutim maracu, ikom jo mabeco ki ikom jo maracu, ikom jo maleng ki ikom jo ma komgi ki keni, ikom ngat ma tyero gitum ki ikom ngat ma pe tyero gitum. Can ma poto ikom dano maber rom aroma ki can ma opoto ikom ngat ma labalo; ki ngat ma kwongo kwong rom ki ngat ma lworo kwongo kwong. <verse eid="ECC 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 9:3" />Man aye gin marac manen ki i gin ducu ma tye katime i lobo man; kit can acel bino pi jo ducu. Dok cwiny dano ducu opong ki gin marac, dok apoya bene tye i cwinygi ikare me kwogi ducu, ka lacen gito woko oyotoyot. <verse eid="ECC 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 9:4" />Ento ngat ma kwo bedo ki gen, pien gwok ma kwo ber kato labwor ma oto. <verse eid="ECC 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 9:5" />Jo makwo gingeyo ni gibito, ento jo ma dong guto woko pe gingeyo gin mo. Gin pe gitye ki kit pwoc mo ma gibilimo, dok wi dano wil woko ikomgi matwal. <verse eid="ECC 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 9:6" />Pe dong gitye ki dul mo ma gibinywako ki jo mukene matwal i tic ducu ma gitye katiyone i lobo man, pien mar meggi ki adagadagagi kacel ki miti ma onongo gitye kwede ducu otyeko gik woko licwic inino ma guto iye.<verse eid="ECC 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 9:7" />Dong imede ki camo kwoni ki yomcwiny, dok imat bwinoni ma nongo cwinyi yom ata; pien Lubanga otyeko pwoyo gin ma itiyo.<verse eid="ECC 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 9:8" />Ruk ginaruka maleng kare ducu, ma pe ikeng wiro wii ki moo bene.<verse eid="ECC 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 9:9" />Bed ki yomcwiny kacel ki dako ma imaro, i mwaka me kwoni ducu ma konye pekeni ka pud ikwo. Tii tici ma kimiyi ka pud irii i lobo man, pien meno aye dul ma gipoko boti i kwoni i lobo man. <verse eid="ECC 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 9:10" />Kit gin mo keken ma cingi onongo me atiya, tii iye ki teki ducu; pien tic nyo tam nyo ngec nyo ryeko mo dong peke i lyel, kama ibicito iyeni.<verse eid="ECC 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 9:11" />Dok aneno ni ngat madwir aye pe loyo ngwec, ngat matek bene pe en aye maloyo lweny, pe ngat ma ryek aye ma nongo kwon ma myero ecam, kadi jo ma tye ki ngec matut pe gin aye ma ginongo lonyo ma dwong, nyo jo makwiri i tic pe gin aye jo ma kipwoyogi, ento kare kacel ki gumkom poto ikomgi ducu. <verse eid="ECC 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 9:12" />Dano acel acel pe ngeyo bino pa nino ma mere. Macalo rec ma kimakogi ki obwo, onyo winyo ma gimoko i owic; kitmeno bene dano kimakogi ki owic ikare ma can marac poto ikomgi atura.<verse eid="ECC 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tam ikom ryeko ki mingo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 9:13" />Dok bene aneno kit labol man kit macalo ryeko tye kwede i lobo, ci onen madit mada ki tung bota. <verse eid="ECC 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 9:14" />Yam tye taun mo matidi ki jo manok keken ma gibedo iye; ci rwot mo madit obino omonyo taun meno kun mito mayone woko, ci ocako toro cel lobo matek orumu taun meno woko dyere. <verse eid="ECC 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 9:15" />Ento dano mo ma lacan ma ryek i taun meno aye ma olaro taun meno ki ryekone. Ento pe tye ngat mo kadi ki acel ma wiye opo ikom dano meno ma lacan. <verse eid="ECC 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 9:16" />Ento aniang ni, ryeko loyo tek kom, kadi bed kicayo ryeko pa dano ma lacan ca, dok bene ngat ma owinyo loke obedo peke.<verse eid="ECC 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 9:17" />Ka iwinyo lok pa ngat ma ryek mot laling, ber kato ma ibedo kawinyo lok pa laloc ma dange kwede adanga i kacoke pa luming. <verse eid="ECC 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 9:18" />Ryeko ber loyo jami lweny, ento labalo acel keken twero balo lwak jami mabeco mapol ata.<verse eid="ECC 9:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ECC 10" />
  <para style="s1">Gin ma mingo kelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 10:1" />Lwango ma oto miyo moo wir makur kwok doko mangwe, mingo matidi bene kitmeno, balo ryeko kacel ki deyone woko.<verse eid="ECC 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 10:2" />Dano ma laryeko paro ki i cwinye me tiyo gin ma tye atir, ento ngat ma laming paro ki i cwinye me timo gin marac.<verse eid="ECC 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 10:3" />Kadi bed inen laming tye kawot i yo, nongo tye ma wiye oding, dok miyo dano ducu ngeyo ni en laming.<verse eid="ECC 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 10:4" />Kace inen kiniga omako laloc magwa ikomi, pe iwek dogtici pien kitwero timo kica pi bal madito ka komi pe oryange.<verse eid="ECC 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 10:5" />Tye gin marac ma aneno i lobo ma obedo calo bal ma oa ki bot laloc. <verse eid="ECC 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 10:6" />Jo maming aye kimiyo gibedo i kabedo me dito, kun lulonyo gibedo i kabedo ma piny adada. <verse eid="ECC 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 10:7" />Aneno opii aye gitye ka ngwec ki aguragura, kun jo me awora giwoto awota ki tyen gi calo gin opii.<verse eid="ECC 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 10:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 7:15">Jab 7:15</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 26:27">Car 26:27</ref></char>
    </note> Ngat ma kwinyo bur bipoto i bur ma en okwinyo, ki ngat ma muku kicika me ot, twol bikayo en.<verse eid="ECC 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 10:9" />Ngat ma tyengo got, got bingolo; ki ngat ma baro yen, yen biketo ret ikome.<verse eid="ECC 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 10:10" />Kace latongi lake olu, ka pe ipako lake, myero itii ki tekoni makato; ento ryeko ber konyo dano weko tice woto maber.<verse eid="ECC 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 10:11" />Ngeyo kit me bango twol pe konyo ka twol dong otyeko kayo dano woko.<verse eid="ECC 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 10:12" />Lok ma dano ma ryek loko miyo dano gipwoye, ento ngat ma laming loko gin ma kelo can ikome kekene.<verse eid="ECC 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 10:13" />Acaki me loke opong ki mingo keken, kaloke me agiki tye me apoya keken.<verse eid="ECC 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 10:14" />Laming nyayo lok doko dwong. Pe tye dano mo ma ngeyo gin ma bitime i anyim, dok anga kono ma twero tito bote gin ma bitime lacen i anyim ma nongo en dong oto woko?<verse eid="ECC 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 10:15" />Laming aye kome loc woko ki tic ma en tiyo, miyo pe ngeyo wa yoo ma en myero okwany me dok gange.<verse eid="ECC 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 10:16" />Jami maracu bitime ikom jo ma laloc me lobogi obedo dano matidi ma laming, dok ka lutelane gibedo mere kacamo karama keken nino ki nino!<verse eid="ECC 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 10:17" />Ento jo me lobo ma laloce obedo dano me awora tye ki gum, kun lutelane bene gicamo cam ikare ma mite, wek gilim teko, ento pe pi mero!<verse eid="ECC 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 10:18" />Ka won ot obedo dano ma lacarcar ci wi ode ryebe woko, dok pi wackome miyo wi ot cwer ka kot ocwer.<verse eid="ECC 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 10:19" />Karama miyo dano bedo ki nyero, ki mato bwino kelo yomcwiny bot jo ma gimato, lim aye ma miyo jami ducu twero tiine.<verse eid="ECC 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 10:20" />Pe ilok lok marac ikom rwot lalingling, dok bene pe ilok lok marac ikom lulonyo ka itye i ot butuni; miyo winyo me polo tingo lok ma iwaconi tero woko, nyo kit gin mo ma bwome tye twero tucu lok meno woko kamaleng.<verse eid="ECC 10:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ECC 11" />
  <para style="s1">Gin ma dano ma ryek tiyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 11:1" />Cwal cami bot jo ma gitye loka nam tungcel, ci ibinongo iye magoba inge kare malac ma tye anyim.<verse eid="ECC 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 11:2" />Tim biacara i kabedo abiro, nyo aboro, pien pe ingeyo gin marac ma bitime i lobo.<verse eid="ECC 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 11:3" />Kace kot dong ocido i pol, ci cwer bino piny i lobo; dok kace yat opoto odok tung acuc, nyo tung acam, ci kabedo kama yat opoto iyeni, en aye yat bibutu iye.<verse eid="ECC 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 11:4" />Ngat ma kuru ni kong enen kama yamo kodo kelo kot, pe twero coyo kodi i ngom; dok ngat ma bedo kaneno mere pol, pe bikayo cam mo.<verse eid="ECC 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 11:5" />Kit macalo pe ingeyo kit ma latin ma i ot nyodo pa dako doko kwede gin makwo, kumeno bene pe ingeyo kit ma Lubanga tiyo jami ducu.<verse eid="ECC 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 11:6" />Coo kodini i odiko, dok i otyeno bene kitmeno pe ijuk cingi katic; pien pe ingeyo mene ma bicek mabup, man nyo maca, nyo ka gwok gin aryo ducu gibibedo maromrom ci gicek maber.<verse eid="ECC 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 11:7" />Dero ceng gin maber, dok neno odiko me nino manyen yomo cwiny dano.<verse eid="ECC 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 11:8" />Kace dano mo obedo i lobo orii pi mwaka mapol, myero en obed ki yomcwiny pi lwak kare magi ducu; ento wiye myero opo ni bedo i lyel bibedo pi kare madwong adada. Gin ma bino ducu obedo gin ma konye peke.<verse eid="ECC 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 11:9" />Bed ki yomcwiny ikare me tinoni ma pud in awobi, lub kit gin ducu ma cwinyi mito ki gin ma wangi oneno. Ento ber inge ni pi jami magi ducu Lubanga bingolo iye kop ikomi.<verse eid="ECC 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 11:10" />Kwany tam me par mapol woko ki i tami, wek pe ibed ki arem ikomi; pien kare me tinoni ki acaki me kwoni ducu konygi peke.<verse eid="ECC 11:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ECC 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 12:1" />Ikare me tinoni, ber ipo ikom Lacwec ma ocweyo in, ma pud peya kare ma opong ki gin marac oo, ma mwaka bene peya onyiko cok, en aye ikare ma ibiwaco ni, “Pe atye ki yomcwiny mo ikomgi.” Ber ipo ikom Lacwec i kare me tinoni <verse eid="ECC 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 12:2" />ma pud peya ceng ki derone, dwe ki lakalatwe gucido woko, dok pol ma kelo kot bene pe biware woko ka dong kot otyeko cwer. <verse eid="ECC 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 12:3" />Ikare meno badi mayam teki, bimyel, ki congi mayam teki dong gibidoko goro, ki laki mayam icamo kwedeni ticgi bigik pien guo woko gudoko nok mo, ki wangi mayam gineno piny ki iwang dirica pe dok gibimede ki neno piny. <verse eid="ECC 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 12:4" />Dok iti bene bidoko nok ma nongo dong pe winyo woo ma igudu; ma nongo kidi rego pe winye matek tutwal, kadi wa winyo dwon luwer bene pe ibiwinyo, ento koko pa winyo aye bicoyo in woko ki iwang nino. <verse eid="ECC 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 12:5" />Ikare meno ibibedo ki lworo pi gin ma tye malo, ki wot bene bibedo tek ki tung boti; yer wi bene biluk lwar; ibiyele ayela wek iywane kanyiko, ci pe dong ibibedo tye ki miti mo icwinyi. Dong watye kawot me cito gire i gangwa kama wabibedo iye matwal, ci kumu dong bibedo tye i yoo gudu. <verse eid="ECC 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 12:6" />Dong myero inen ni itamo matut ikom Lubanga, pien kwowa dong cok gik woko, calo nyor me ryal onyo atabo me jabu ma to nginye woko oyotoyot, onyo calo agulu pii ma to woko iwang it, nyo tol latel latwom pii ma cot woko ki wang pii. <verse eid="ECC 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 12:7" />Ci komwa bene bitop dok ingom, apwa bene dok ikom ngom ka mayam oa ki iye, ki cwiny dano dok bot Lubanga mayam omiyo botwa. <verse eid="ECC 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 12:8" />Latit lok owaco ni; konye peke, konye peke adada, man ducu konye peke.<verse eid="ECC 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok me agiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 12:9" />Medo ikom lok me ryeko, Latit lok bene opwonyo lwak ki gin ma en ngeyo, ma opimo dok ongiyo matut, ka dong ocano carolok ducu kikore kun gwoke matek. <verse eid="ECC 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 12:10" />Latit lok otemo nongo lok ma kweyo cwiny dano, ci en ocoyo lok me ada ki cwiny ma tye atir.<verse eid="ECC 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 12:11" />Lok ma dano ma ryek waco ducu obedo macalo dim, dok calo cumar ma kiguro odonyo matek, en aye lok ma Lubanga, ma en aye Lakwat acel loko. <verse eid="ECC 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 12:12" />Latina, tye dok gin mukene ma myero igwoke iye. Coyo buk mapol pe gik, dok kwan tutwal ma okato kare olo kom dano nono.<verse eid="ECC 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 12:13" />Inge lok magi ducu; dong atye ki lok acel keken ma amito wacone: lwor Lubanga dok ilub cike ducu, pien man aye obedo gin acel ma omiyo kicweyo dano ducu. <verse eid="ECC 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 12:14" />Lubanga bingolokop pi kit tim ducu ma watiyo, wa ki gin ducu ma watimo i mung, kadi ber nyo rac.<verse eid="ECC 12:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 12" />
</usx>